    "created_at": "2016-09-26T09:24:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T09:24:29Z",
    "body": "I haven't heard of this issue before. That this changed between IE and Edge could mean that there's some content that depends on it, or a bunch of code was just rewritten and this happened to change.\n\nI tested the foo.html in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1518#issue-164404944 and AFAICT Chrome and Firefox have the same behavior. More detailed tests and reports including browser version numbers might be helpful.\n\nNot sure who might know how this works in Blink, maybe @zetafunction?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
