    "created_at": "2016-09-26T09:47:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T18:09:44Z",
    "body": "In Blink, this check is enforced in https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/adba2165f4c6e1c7d4a78179d6e066aa8e37f938/third_party/WebKit/Source/core/frame/LocalFrame.cpp#740.\n\nThe comment claims that some sites that depend on this behavior, but if IE and Firefox didn't support this...\n\n(Incidentally, it looks like the Blink check is probably broken with out-of-process iframes. Oops. ~~Edit: just kidding~~ Edit 2: nope, totally broken.)\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
