    "updated_at": "2016-10-04T14:12:10Z",
    "body": "Having written that down, I guess the question is what happens when the nesting is A loading B and B loading A. Does that result in A > B > A > B > about:blank? Same for A loading B, B loading C, and C loading A. Does that result in A > B > C > A > B > C > about:blank?\n",
